  lines:
  - speaker: "尼"
    text: "早上好呀，伊。"
    charactersPerSecond: 0
    minimumDisplaySeconds: 0
    cue: ""
  - speaker: "尼"
    text: "今天感觉心情怎么样？"
    charactersPerSecond: 0
    minimumDisplaySeconds: 0
    cue: ""
  - speaker: "伊"
    text: "心情？"
    charactersPerSecond: 0
    minimumDisplaySeconds: 0
    cue: ""
  - speaker: "伊"
    text: "我觉得很开心？"
    charactersPerSecond: 0
    minimumDisplaySeconds: 0
    cue: ""
  - speaker: "尼"
    text: "那就是心情很好咯！"
    charactersPerSecond: 0
    minimumDisplaySeconds: 0
    cue: ""
  - speaker: "尼"
    text: "走吧，我们去进行实验吧。"
    charactersPerSecond: 0
    minimumDisplaySeconds: 0
    cue: ""
  - speaker: "伊"
    text: "O(∩_∩)O~"
    charactersPerSecond: 0
    minimumDisplaySeconds: 0
    cue: ""
  stagingNotes: "原稿第16段：感到开心的早晨。句尾c为手动翻页标记，已移除；未标c的同角色连续行保留换行。尚未绑定场景触发、情感解锁或演出事件。"
